# The moon bat (Vesper keeps her name)
"Who wakes me under the blood moon?" = "Wer weckt mich unter dem Blutmond?"
"I came for the key the moon keeps." = "Ich will den Schlüssel, den der Mond hütet."
"Stay, then. You will not leave." = "Dann bleib. Hier kommst du nicht mehr raus."
"You" = "Du"
"The moon... is setting..." = "Der Mond... geht unter..."

# Commands and charms
"Commands" = "Techniken"
"None" = "Keine"
"Crimson Charm" = "Purpuramulett"
"Up, Down + R: absorb blood." = "Oben, Unten + R: Blut aufnehmen."
"Moon Charm" = "Mondamulett"
"Down, Up + A: flip gravity." = "Unten, Oben + A: Schwerkraft umkehren."
"Lunge" = "Ausfall"
"Down, Down-Fwd, Fwd + B" = "Unten, Unten-Vor, Vor + B"
"A dash forward, blade first: twice the weapon's strength." = "Ein Satz nach vorn, die Klinge voran: doppelte Kraft der Waffe."
"Flurry" = "Hagel"
"Fwd, Fwd + B" = "Vor, Vor + B"
"Three quick stabs." = "Drei schnelle Stiche."
"Blood Absorb" = "Blutsog"
"Up, Down + R" = "Oben, Unten + R"
"Draws blood from all around and heals with it." = "Zieht Blut aus allem ringsum und heilt damit."
"Gravity Flip" = "Schwerkraftwende"
"Down, Up + A" = "Unten, Oben + A"
"Up becomes down: walk on the ceiling. Again to turn it back." = "Oben wird unten: an der Decke gehen. Noch einmal kehrt es zurück."
"Rising Slash" = "Steigender Hieb"
"Fwd, Down, Down-Fwd + B" = "Vor, Unten, Unten-Vor + B"
"Two cuts on the way up." = "Zwei Hiebe im Aufsteigen."
"Flame Burst" = "Flammenstoß"
"Down, Down + B" = "Unten, Unten + B"
"Fire all around, three times." = "Feuer ringsum, dreimal."
"Slip Stab" = "Ausweichstich"
"Back, Fwd + B" = "Zurück, Vor + B"
"A hop back, then a stab where you were." = "Ein Sprung zurück, dann ein Stich, wo du warst."
"Ground Breaker" = "Bodenbrecher"
"One great blow that strikes on both sides." = "Ein gewaltiger Schlag nach beiden Seiten."
"Whirlwind" = "Wirbelwind"
"Back, Down-Back, Down, Down-Fwd, Fwd + B" = "Zurück, Unten-Zurück, Unten, Unten-Vor, Vor + B"
"The axe spins: four strikes all around." = "Die Axt kreist: vier Schläge ringsum."
"Long Lash" = "Langer Hieb"
"The chain at its longest." = "Die Kette in voller Länge."
"Twirl" = "Wirbel"
"Down, Up + B" = "Unten, Oben + B"
"The chain whirls around you three times." = "Die Kette wirbelt dreimal um dich."
"Volley" = "Salve"
"Three knives in quick succession." = "Drei Messer kurz nacheinander."
"Leaping Throw" = "Sprungwurf"
"A leap, and two knives from the air." = "Ein Sprung und zwei Messer aus der Luft."
"Lance" = "Lanze"
"Long and straight: thrusts up, and down from the air." = "Lang und gerade: sticht nach oben und aus der Luft nach unten."
"Charge" = "Ansturm"
"A run forward behind the point." = "Ein Lauf nach vorn hinter der Spitze."
"Sky Thrust" = "Himmelsstich"
"A leap with the point up, twice." = "Ein Sprung mit der Spitze nach oben, zweimal."
